timestamp: 2025-04-22T01:15:00Z
body: Regarding the file length concern, I propose the following strategy:
1. Create separate .ftai files for each major project
2. Implement a weekly/monthly rotation system
3. Archive older communications in a separate directory
4. Maintain a master index file for quick reference

@decision
id: 1
title: File Management Strategy
status: proposed
content: Split communications into project-specific files with periodic rotation
impact: Will prevent single file from becoming too large
implementation: Create new file for each major project, archive older files monthly

